config LED_MCH2022_RP2040
	bool "MCH2022 badge LCD backlight"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_BADGETEAM_MCH2022_RP2040_BACKLIGHT_ENABLED
	depends on MFD_MCH2022_RP2040
	help
	  Enable the driver for the MCH2022 badge's LCD backlight, dimmed by
	  its RP2040 coprocessor. The backlight is LED 0.
